functional information about each patient’s disease.\\nIt matches therapies more precisely to individual patients by uniting innovative clinical trial designs with cutting-edge diagnostics, such as:\\nAdvanced imaging\\nGenetic profiling\\nDrug-sensitivity testing\\nThis field brings together physicians, scientists, and other key stakeholders across preclinical, translational, and clinical research. Through this collaboration, precision hematology aims to:\\nAccelerate the discovery of new treatment strategies\\nRefine therapeutic decision-making\\nImprove outcomes for patients with blood cancers\\nOur program’s goals\\nOur Precision Hematology Topics-in-Focus program is designed to promote innovative concepts for diagnostics and innovative clinical trial designs which will feed into the clinical application of precision hematology.\\nThe goal of the program is to create a European regulatory framework for precision hematology. By increasing awareness and providing education, guidelines, and policies, we can improve access to:\\nDiagnostics\\nClinical research\\nTreatment in malignant hematology\\nUseful materials\\nEHA Position Paper on Personalized Treatment for Hematologic Diseases\\nPrecision Medicine in Hematology in 2021: Definitions, Tools, Perspectives, and Open Questions\\nIn Vitro Diagnostic Medical\"}], \"local_exploration\": {\"visited_doc_ids\": [\"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"web-740265f7f67c3ce2a194ca41\", \"web-b6c9d3593c6121cf0281911b\", \"web-c60022ff9847a5c52747af0c\"], \"visited_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/\", \"title\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants\", \"title\": \"Grants - The European He